{
  "question": "What is the deadline for submitting an expense reimbursement?",
  "model": "deepseek-flash",
  "actual": {
    "status": "conflict",
    "answer": "The documents give two different submission deadlines, so the applicable deadline cannot be determined without confirmation:\n\n- 《员工费用报销制度》: reimbursement must be submitted within **30 days** after the expense occurs (D01, section 4).\n- 《费用报销时限附表》附表1: for expense reimbursement, counting from the expense date, the submission deadline is **15 days** (D02, table 1).\n\nBoth documents are dated 2025-01-01, and neither states which prevails. Please confirm whether the 30-day rule in the main policy or the 15-day rule in the annex applies. (Under the main policy, a late submission also requires a written explanation reviewed by the finance lead — D01, section 5.)",
    "gaps": [
      "Which document takes precedence: the 30-day main policy or the 15-day annex table",
      "Whether the 15-day table applies only to specific expense types or to all reimbursements"
    ],
